Subject: [PATCH] Add WASI runtime compatibility layer

Add OSCompatWASI.cpp with WASI versions of the oscompat memory, page
size, thread and process helpers. Large aligned allocations use
aligned_alloc with the size rounded up to the alignment, and queries WASI
cannot answer return std::errc::operation_not_supported. Keep the date
cache, sampling profiler and process statistics on paths WASI supports.

Upstream: not submitted. Needed only for a WASI target.
